GAMEVAULT IMPLEMENTATION STATUS AND STEAM INTEGRATION READINESS AUDIT

Audit scope: read-only inspection of authentication, Supabase schema, Express backend, frontend integration, environment configuration, and security.

OVERALL STATUS

The UI prototype is substantial, but Steam integration is not implemented. Development authentication works locally. The database migration exists but the identity and Supabase integration boundaries are incomplete. Steam OpenID, Steam Web API calls, OAuth/token storage, synchronization, and wishlist persistence are missing.

1. AUTHENTICATION FOUNDATION

Status: PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED

Implemented:
- POST /api/auth/dev/login creates an in-memory signed development session for a fixed development user.
- GET /api/auth/session restores session state.
- POST /api/auth/logout destroys the session and clears the cookie.
- The frontend AuthProvider restores authentication state on load.
- Protected frontend routes redirect unauthenticated users to /login.
- The frontend development-login button is visible only in Vite development mode.
- requireAuth middleware validates the in-memory session cookie and can attach req.user.

